#====================================================================
# DRAFT-easyhttpcpp-2.1.0-poco-1.15-autoptr-return-api
#====================================================================

id:                     DRAFT-easyhttpcpp-2.1.0-poco-1.15-autoptr-return-api
trigger_tool:           clang|cmake|conan|test
phase:                  compilation
error_signature:        cannot cast from type 'Channel::Ptr'|cannot cast from type 'Formatter::Ptr'|getChannel\(\)|getFormatter\(\)|static_cast<.*FormattingChannel\*>|static_cast<.*PatternFormatter\*>

severity:               2
category:               cxx|poco|portability|testing|conan
match_keywords:         Poco, 1.15, AutoPtr, Channel::Ptr, Formatter::Ptr, getChannel, getFormatter, static_cast, FormattingChannel, PatternFormatter, .get()
title:                  Poco 1.15 的 getChannel()/getFormatter() 返回 AutoPtr，static_cast 需先 .get()

root_cause:             Poco 1.15 把 Logger::getChannel()、FormattingChannel::getChannel()、FormattingChannel::getFormatter() 的返回类型从裸指针改为 AutoPtr<T>（Channel::Ptr / Formatter::Ptr）。依赖旧版裸指针返回值的上游测试代码直接 static_cast<T*> 编译失败，属 Poco API 演进导致的消费者源码兼容问题，非平台缺陷。

affected_scope:         消费 Poco 1.15+ 且测试/工具代码对 getChannel()/getFormatter()/getChannel() 返回值做 static_cast<T*> 的 C++ 库及其 Conan 消费者；升级 Poco 1.15 时统一改为 .get() 后再转换。

verification_cmd:       cmake -S . -B build -DENABLE_TESTS=ON -DCMAKE_TOOLCHAIN_FILE=generators/conan_toolchain.cmake && cmake --build build -j4 && ./build/bin/easyhttp-UnitTestRunner

rec_priority:           2
rec_approach:           autoptr-return-value-dot-get-before-cast
